# GMS's third Frailty Curse hyper deepens the Speed penalty, which this game
# can't model. Renamed for DEF instead, like both archers' Sharp Eyes - Bulwark,
# and just as worthless on purpose: DEF stops paying at a share of the attacking
# monster's attack, and a 4th job character passes that cap on their stats
# alone.
name: "Frailty Curse - Bulwark"
description: "Grants Frailty Curse a bonus to DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD skill_order: 8 }
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base { def: 500 }
